<para>Compare blocks from two if-regions, where.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>true if <computeroutput>Block1</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>Block2</computeroutput> contain identical instructions, and have no memory reference alias with <computeroutput>Head2</computeroutput>. This is used as a legality check for merging if-regions.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
