<para>is a block in the 2nd if-region to compare. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if Block1 and Block2 have identical instructions and do not have memory reference alias with Head2. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
